/P 626 0 R
/E (The receiver need only count the number of 1s in the received d + 1 bits. If an odd number of 1-valued bits are found with an even parity scheme, the receiver knows that at least one bit error has occurred. More precisely, it knows that some odd number of bit errors have occurred.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
